                                "description": "Data retention policies help to limit the disk space consumption by removing obsolete data. Use this method to inspect the retention policies that are in effect for the parent organization of the given organization. Application reports created by continuous monitoring are not affected by the stage retention policy. They appear separately under the key continuous-monitoring.\nPermissions required: View IQ Elements"
